<addressbook><name>NISHIO, KOJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SANYO ELECTRIC CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJIMOTO MASAHISA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJITANI SHIN</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NISHIO KOJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJIMOTO, MASAHISA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJITANI, SHIN</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NISHIO, KOJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A solid electrolytic capacitor which comprises a positive electrode, a dielectrics film formed on the positive electrode by anodic oxidation, a solid electrolyte layer formed on the dielectrics film, and a negative electrode jointed to the solid electrolyte layer, wherein the solid electrolyte layer comprises a conductive polymer comprising a polymer having, as a recurring unit, a heterocyclic monomer unit represented by general formula (I), and an alkylsulfonic acid ion doped into the polymer. The solid electrolytic capacitor has a large capacitance and exhibits a small impedance at a high frequency region.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un condensateur électrolytique solide comprenant une électrode positive, un film diélectrique formé sur cette électrode positive par anodisation, une couche électrolytique solide formée sur ce film diélectrique, et une électrode négative assemblée à cette couche électrolytique solide, laquelle renferme par ailleurs un polymère conducteur contenant un polymère dont le motif récurrent se présente sous la forme d'un motif monomère hétérocyclique désigné par formule générale (I), et un ion d'acide alkylsulfonique dopé dans ce polymère. Le condensateur électrolytique solide de cette invention présente une capacité élevée et une faible impédance dans une zone haute fréquence.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>